## How seasons work

Seasons in Marathon last about three months.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Each season gives a fresh start with progression resets for gear, contracts, factions, and player level.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Cosmetics, titles, Codex progression, and liaison contract progression carry over between seasons.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Seasonal updates introduce new content like weapons, mods, shells, zones, events, and more, free for all players.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}}

## Season 1 and Season 2

Season 1, titled Death Is The First Step, introduced the Marathon derelict and the Perimeter setting on Tau Ceti IV.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Season 1 included Ranked in beta, with the first Ranked window in March as Low Stakes only.{{cite:bungie-ranked}} Season 2 began June 2, 2026 and launched with an Open Play Week from June 2 to June 9.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Season 2 added Night Marsh, the Sentinel defensive shell, the Cradle customization system, and new weapons.{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}} Mid-Season 2 introduced Vault Breaker, a roguelite experimental PvE mode inside Cryo Archive, live July 21.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}}

## Nightfall Refresh and Symbiosis roadmap

The Nightfall Refresh began October and rebuilt progression, rewards, and the live experience.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} The Nightfall Refresh included a no-cost NuCal inspired Reward Pass available to owners and recurring Sponsored Queues weekends.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} Bungie announced Symbiosis for December introduces Marathon’s first permanent PvE, a larger Perimeter, a new shell, improved onboarding, and a social space.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} Symbiosis launches December 8 with an Open Play Week December 8–15 and limited Crew Up rewards through December 22.{{cite:bungie-press-symbiosis}}

## Experimental queues and future plans

Experimental queues were introduced in Season 1, including Duos and Sponsored Queue tests.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Season 2 added Duos Queue with a rotating daily map schedule and ongoing evaluation.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

