## Who they are

CyberAcme is a megacorporation in Marathon focused on digital technology and artificial intelligence functionality.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} All Marathon Runner shells have CyberAcme's Onboard Navigation Intelligence installed.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Bungie listed CyberAcme among the factions playable during the Server Slam preview.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}} Bungie and outlets list CyberAcme as one of Marathon's six factions at launch.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}}

## What they offer Runners

CyberAcme stocks basic armory items such as ammo, healing consumables, basic weapons, backpacks, and keys.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Rank-up rewards from CyberAcme include ammo, torso implants, and backpacks.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} CyberAcme Sponsored Kits have had their starting ammo increased in Update 1.0.0.4 (March 11, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-0-0-4}} Enhanced and Deluxe CyberAcme Sponsored Kits unlock at Runner levels listed in Season 2 documentation.{{cite:kotaku-season-2}}

## Recent changes and activities

When the Cryo Archive zone is available, seven unique Cryo contracts appear in CyberAcme's pool.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} Bungie fixed a CyberAcme contract display issue in Update 1.1.0.1 (June 9, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-0-1}} CyberAcme joined other parties in a Runner non-aggression pact ahead of the Expedition Phase 1 update.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}}

