## Overview

NuCaloric is a Marathon faction described as an agricultural company focused on food production and humanity's survival.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Bungie included NuCaloric among the early factions playable in the Server Slam preview.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}} Bungie introduced a NuCaloric contract in an early post-launch update (Update 1.0.0.4, March 11, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-0-0-4}}

## What NuCaloric offers Runners

NuCaloric faction rank rewards include consumables, NuCaloric salvage items, and implants.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} NuCaloric's armory offers healing consumables that remove status effects, self-revives, shields, and implants.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} NuCaloric provides a family of head, torso, and leg implants that support healing and durability.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} GamesRadar lists methods to gain NuCaloric reputation, including completing NuCaloric contracts and looting medical cabinets.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}}

## Recent changes and events

The Nightfall Refresh added a NuCaloric Reward Pass available at no extra cost to Marathon owners (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} Bungie also released a NuCaloric inspired Reward Pass with new NuCal skins during the Nightfall Refresh update.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} Nightfall Refresh reset Runner, Cradle, and Faction levels as part of its release (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} A follow-up update fixed an issue where NuCal weapon styles' Stickers were not displaying correctly (Update 1.1.9.7, November 10, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-7}} An earlier update corrected the NuCaloric Armored Barter icon in the Armory (Update 1.1.0.1, June 9, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-0-1}}

