## Who they are

Traxus OffWorld Industries is described as the most powerful corporation in human history.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Its agent Vulcan tasks Runners with salvaging valuables to recoup Marathon mission losses.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Traxus is one of the five factions playable during the Server Slam preview.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}}

## What Traxus offers Runners

Traxus rank-up rewards include weapon chip mods, Traxus Salvage items, and weapons.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} The Traxus armory offers weapons and mods of all kinds.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Players can gain Traxus reputation by completing Traxus contracts and exfiltrating with Traxus valuables.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Several Traxus contracts are listed in the priority contract sequence for the faction.{{cite:marathonwiki-com-priority-contracts}}

## Traxus and Night Marsh

Traxus has Night Marsh exclusive interest in investigating UESC secrets on Night Marsh.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Night Marsh availability and contracts rotate with Dire Marsh during Season 2.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

## Recent changes to Traxus offerings

Update 1.1.9.2 (October 6, 2026) reduced Deluxe sponsored kit stock and decreased Traxus weapon rarity from Superior to Deluxe.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} Update 1.1.9.7 (November 10, 2026) repeated those Armory reductions, again lowering Traxus weapon stock and rarities.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-7}} Update 1.1.0.1 (June 9, 2026) fixed an Armory tooltip error related to a Traxus Prestige mod cost display.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-0-1}} Mid-Season 2 updates included faster faction progression and Armory sponsored kit adjustments.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}}

