## Overview

MIDA is a faction in Marathon introduced during the Server Slam preview period.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}} GamesRadar describes MIDA as a political-party-turned-anarchist-terrorist group from Mars.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} MIDA operates through an agent named Gantry.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}}

## What MIDA offers

MIDA provides contracts Runners can complete for reputation and rewards.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} MIDA rank-up rewards include equipment, MIDA Salvage items, and Leg Implants.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} The MIDA Armory offers grenades, gadgets, Cardio Kick, Anti-Virus Kit consumables, and Implants.{{cite:gamesradar-factions}} Bungie moved faction shell upgrades to the Cradle and added faction-specific implant families, with MIDA's focusing on mobility or disruption.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

## Night Marsh involvement

MIDA has Night Marsh exclusive contracts introduced in Season 2.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Bungie said MIDA is interested in learning what the UESC hides in Night Marsh's dark areas.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

## Recent changes and tuning

Update 1.0.0.4 (March 11, 2026) increased starting ammo in MIDA free Sponsored Kits.{{cite:bungie-update-1-0-0-4}} Update 1.1.0.1 (June 9, 2026) fixed a MIDA Expose/Extinguish issue where the Gantry voice could fail to play.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-0-1}} Update 1.1.9.2 (October 6, 2026) reduced MIDA Armory Deluxe sponsored kit stock from 3/week to 2/week and removed Superior kits.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} Update 1.1.9.7 (November 10, 2026) reiterated MIDA Armory stock reductions and decreased weekly themed weapon availability and rarities.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-7}}

