## Overview

Recon is an intel specialist Runner shell.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Recon excels at identifying threats and tracking movement.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Recon's kit includes echo pulses, tracker drones, and holographic footstep trails.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

## Abilities

Echo Pulse now fires pulses in a cone in the player's aim direction (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} Echo Pulse now staggers enemy non-Runner combatants and briefly prevents their combat abilities when first struck (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Traits

Interrogation's notification to pinged Recon players is delayed by two seconds (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Notable Changes

Bungie stated Echo Pulse is less oppressive and mandatory after the October 6, 2026 changes.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} Developers said limiting Echo Pulse to a cone forces Recon players to predict targets in three-dimensional space (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

