## Overview

Triage is described as a field medic archetype for Runner shells.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

Triage shells support allies with deployable healing drones.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

Triage shells include onboard reboot abilities to assist revivals.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

## Abilities and Implants

Season 2 reworked implants so each implant grants a single fixed perk and fixed stats.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}}

The Triage Cloaking Device torso implant grants Revive Speed, Tactical Recovery, and Hardware.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}}

In Season 2 implants are named for their perk to make selection easier in the Vault and quick loot screens.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

## Notable Changes and Media

Season 2 introduced the Cradle system to progress Runner shells across the season.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

Triage is included among Runner shells listed for a Bungie Rewards exfil challenge.{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}}

Bungie released a Triage Shell cinematic as part of their shell cinematics lineup.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}}

PC Gamer reported Triage will be present in Marathon's full release despite absence from the alpha.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}}

