## Overview

Sentinel is a defensive specialist shell built for carving out and securing pockets of space on the battlefield.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Season 2 introduced Sentinel as a new Runner shell available with the season's launch.{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}}

## Abilities and Trait

Defender System is Sentinel’s Prime ability and deploys a defensive platform that neutralizes incoming explosives and boosts nearby allies' weapon handling.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Bungie also described Defender System as an automated laser platform that shoots incoming grenades and missiles and boosts nearby weapon handling.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Snare Mine is Sentinel’s Tactical ability and throws a proximity-triggered mine that detonates into multiple immobilizing submunitions.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Prey Tracker is a Trait ability that activates HUD motion tracking to show moving enemies on radar within a conical forward zone.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Castle Doctrine is Sentinel’s passive, granting faster ready and reload for SMGs, Pistols, and Shotguns based on nearby hostiles and increased resistances after splash damage.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}}

## Runner Cores and Perks

Season 2 adds a suite of ten Sentinel-specific Runner cores spanning rarity tiers.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Reversal (Enhanced) heals the player over time after defeating an immobilized target.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Wellness Beacon (Deluxe) increases medical item use speed for players standing near a deployed Defender System.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Eminent Domain (Prestige) makes Runner grenades neutralized by a Defender System fall to the floor as lootable items.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}}

## Notable Changes and Fixes

A July mid-season update reiterated Sentinel as a Season 2 shell while detailing wider sandbox and balance updates.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}} Update 1.1.9.2 (October 6, 2026) fixed an issue where certain grenades could get stuck when they impacted surfaces inside an ally's Defender System radius.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} Update 1.1.0.1 (June 9, 2026) fixed a Sentinel-related challenge issue where “Information Economy” could not be completed after meeting its requirements.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-0-1}}

