## Surface Zones

Marathon features three surface zones: Perimeter, Dire Marsh, and Outpost.{{cite:bungie-vidoc}}

## Perimeter and Dire Marsh

Perimeter is set on the colony’s outskirts and is described as the most beginner-friendly map.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Dire Marsh centers on a disaster site with a central complex and focuses on straightforward action.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Perimeter and Dire Marsh were playable during the Marathon Server Slam event.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}}

## Outpost

Outpost is a UESC military installation built around a vertical megastructure called the Pinwheel.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Outpost unlocks the day after launch and requires Runner Level 12 to access.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}}

