## Setting

Outpost is set in the middle of a functioning UESC military installation on Tau Ceti IV.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}} The zone is part of Tau Ceti IV, a derelict colony surveyed from fragmented transmissions and field data.{{cite:marathon-official-site}} Outpost is described as a smaller map with greater verticality built around the Pinwheel megastructure.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}}

## Layout highlights

The Pinwheel is an imposing three‑pronged megastructure at Outpost's center.{{cite:pcgamer-review}} Outpost combines factories, dormitories, and air hangars into a large compound-like environment.{{cite:pcgamer-review}} The contained layout makes concealment harder, increasing encounters with robots and other players.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Outpost includes multiple entry routes into the Pinwheel, with five or six different approaches noted.{{cite:pcgamer-review}}

## Access rules

Outpost unlocks for players at Runner Level 12 the day after launch.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Ranked weekends rotate planet-side zones and include Outpost as a possible weekend map.{{cite:bungie-ranked}} Duos Queue rotates daily and explicitly includes Outpost in its Season 2 rotation.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

