## What seasonal resets wipe

Seasonal resets clear players' gear, contract progression, faction progression, and player level.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Seasonal resets remove Vault assets and personalized Armory access at season end.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

## What carries over between seasons

Players retain achievements, earned and paid cosmetics, titles, and other seasonal rewards.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Codex progression carries over across seasons and does not reset.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} Liaison contract progression and unlocked factions carry over between seasons.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Any Cryo Archive Subroutines collected in Season 1 carry forward into Season 2.{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}}

## October 2026 Nightfall Refresh

The Nightfall Refresh launched Oct 6, 2026 as the first step toward larger roadmap goals.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} Nightfall Refresh reset progression and the in-game economy to restore default Cradle and faction upgrades.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}}

