## Overview

Implant power scales with rarity tiers that run from gray up to gold.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Some implants will only exist at higher rarity tiers after the Season 2 change.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

## Named rarities and colours

Bungie names a Standard tier in Server Slam reward caches.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}} Bungie names an Enhanced tier and labels it Green in Server Slam rewards.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}} Bungie names a Deluxe tier and labels it Blue in Server Slam rewards.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}}

## Additional notes

Season 2 made implants defined by their perk first and gave them fixed stats.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Season 2 reduced some items' rarity from Superior to Deluxe in Armory updates (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

